educe speed and use caution while approaching the area.\"},\"messageLang3\":{\"message\":\"Centro de Fort Myers: Se preven retrasos en los carriles en direccion norte del Puente Edison al otro lado del Rio Caloosahatchee debido a obras de construccion. Se recomienda a los conductores reducir la velocidad y extremar las precauciones al acercarse a la area.\"}},\"regions\":[\"\"],\"filterRegions\":false,\"highImportance\":false},{\"messages\":{\"messageLang1\":{\"message\":\"Jacksonville: There is lane-blocking construction on US-17/N Main St between the Trout River Bridge and Broward Rd. Use caution in the area.\"},\"messageLang2\":{\"message\":\"Jacksonville: There is lane-blocking construction on US-17/N Main St between the Trout River Bridge and Broward Rd. Use caution in the area.\"},\"messageLang3\":{\"message\":\"Jacksonville: There is lane-blocking construction on US-17/N Main St between the Trout River Bridge and Broward Rd. Use caution in the area.\"}},\"regions\":[\"\"],\"filterRegions\":false,\"highImportance\":false},{\"messages\":{\"messageLang1\":{\"message\":\"St Augustine: There is lane blocking construction on A1A between S Ocean Grande Dr and 5th St. Use caution in the area.\"},\"messageLang2\":{\"message\":\"St Augustine: There is lane blocking construction on A1A between S Ocean Grande Dr and 5th St. Use caution in the area.\"},\"messageLang3\":{\"message\":\"St Augustine: There is lane blocking construction on A1A between S Ocean Grande Dr and 5th St. Use caution in the area.\"}},\"regions\":[\"\"],\"filterRegions\":false,\"highImportance\":false},{\"messages\":{\"messageLang1\":{\"message\":\"Jacksonville: Due to a crash on US-17/Roosevelt Blvd at Target/120 Th St , all SB lanes are blocked. Use caution and seek alternate routes.\"},\"messageLang2\":{\"message\":\"Jacksonville: Due to a crash on US-17/Roosevelt Blvd at Target/120 Th St , all SB lanes are blocked. Use caution and seek alternate routes.\"},\"messageLang3\":{\"message\":\"Jacksonvi